WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.532
Lost your phone? And the backup with it?

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:07.044
Your hardware wallet and your guardian start a recovery.

3
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.434
It waits seven days, and alerts you and your contacts every day.

4
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:18.432
If someone else started it, any of your devices or contacts can cancel it.

5
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:24.407
If nobody cancels, your guardian co-signs the move to your new wallet.

6
00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:28.455
Your server. Your contacts. No support ticket.

7
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.450
Trikey. Pre-alpha, and building in public.
